WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:04.840
The Kaiapoi Town Centre has changed a lot
throughout the years.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:10.730
And while much was lost during the earthquakes,
we’ve rebuilt and Kaiapoi continues to grow.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:17.360
Now, Mixed-Use Business Areas provide us with
a unique opportunity to rethink our Town Centre,

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.360
and plan for its future.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.340
We want Kaiapoi to be New Zealand’s Best Rivertown,

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.340
a great place to live, shop, dine and relax.

